cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus or site, please cite it as below."
title: "Magami NTD: an open, cited map of neglected tropical diseases"
abstract: >-
  A public, cited knowledge graph of neglected tropical diseases: one page for
  every disease, pathogen, vector, treatment, diagnostic, target, technology,
  trial, institution, country, roadmap, guideline, bottleneck and idea, with a
  plain-English TL;DR and at least one primary source on every page. The corpus
  ships as a website, a static JSON API, and language-model context files.
type: dataset
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-17"
license:
  - AGPL-3.0-only
  - CC-BY-SA-4.0
url: "https://ntd.magamios.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Magami-Open-Sciences-Initiative/ntd"
keywords:
  - neglected tropical diseases
  - NTDs
  - global health
  - parasitology
  - open data
  - knowledge graph
  - drug discovery
authors:
  - name: "Magami Open Sciences Initiative"
    website: "https://magamios.org"
message-note: >-
  Software is AGPL-3.0-only; the data is CC BY-SA 4.0, free to reuse (including
  commercially) with attribution and share-alike, so derivatives stay open.
